          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On June 22, 194, a witness reported seeing from his vehicle a glowing sphere descending to the ground, then taking off again while splitting into three. The following day, the gendarmes on the scene found military personnel using a cannon positioned at the site of the observation. Although we have no other information, these military maneuvers taking place in the region are likely to explain the phenomenon observed.",
